=== 규칙 기반 추천 결과 ===
규칙:
  - movie >= 4 AND game >= 4  -> SF fan
  - sports >= 4 AND food >= 4 -> Active foodie
  - music >= 4               -> Music lover
  - otherwise                -> Explorer

